@page "/"

<PageTitle>Vehicle Management</PageTitle>

<main class="home">
    <header class="home-header">
        <h1>Vehicle Management</h1>
        <p>Manage vehicle details and organise vehicles into categories based on their weight.</p>
    </header>

    <p class="availability">Vehicle and category management will be available soon.</p>

    <div class="feature-grid">
        <section class="feature" aria-labelledby="vehicles-heading">
            <h2 id="vehicles-heading">Vehicles</h2>
            <p>Record the owner, manufacturer, year of manufacture and weight of each vehicle.</p>
            <p>Browse vehicle records and sort by owner, manufacturer, year or weight.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="feature" aria-labelledby="categories-heading">
            <h2 id="categories-heading">Categories</h2>
            <p>Manage category names, weight boundaries and icons.</p>
            <p>Each vehicle's category is determined by its weight and the current category configuration.</p>
        </section>
    </div>
</main>
